{"id": 1007851, "slug": "bus-flipper-renovator-simulator", "name": "Bus Flipper: Renovator Simulator", "name_original": "Bus Flipper: Renovator Simulator", "description": "<h3>I was made for this!</h3><p>Your friend got an abandoned old bus. He asks for your help in converting it into a cafe. <strong>Can you handle it?</strong></p><p>⠀</p><h3>Best job i've ever had!</h3><p>Clean up, wash away all the dirt, break up the old junk and <strong>create something beautiful out of this nightmare!</strong> Consider the requests of the customers, everyone will want to add their unique desires to your list of tasks</p><p>⠀</p><h3>How about some coffee?</h3><p>You can transform a bus into anything, even into a <strong>CAFE</strong>!</p><p>⠀</p><h3>Jack of all trades 😎</h3><p>Or even into a <strong>REAL motorhome!</strong> Wow!</p><p>⠀</p><h3>Great and small</h3><p>You are free to make creative decisions on the conversion of buses and minivans to suit various needs</p><p>⠀</p><h3>Cheque, please!</h3><p>Get a worthy reward for your actions and <strong>make your dreams come true!</strong></p><p>⠀</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-07-31", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-10-02T01:08:11", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/c85/c8582ede13774029322f772fc0907c47.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/dea/dea61d50765b23bc865a700e15e0d7f9.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 3, "ratings": [{"id": 3, "title": "meh", "count": 3, "percent": 60.0}, {"id": 1, "title": "skip", "count": 2, "percent": 40.0}], "reactions": {}, "added": 5, "added_by_status": {"beaten": 2, "toplay": 1, "dropped": 2}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 11, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_